/*  hole-11-86216.cufe: the model says some run reaches freed memory; `check` accepts it.
    chance true: CRASH 0xc0000005; chance false: CRASH 0xc0000005  */

Define chance as true permanently.
Bind series of number to f0, given (the series of number p0):
    p0 becomes a series of number.
    p0 becomes p0.
    Return p0.
Done.
Bind series of series of number to f1:
    Pull a rabbit.
        Return a series of series of number.
    Done.
    Define v1 as a series of number.
    Return a series of series of number.
Done.
Define v2 as a series of number.
Define v3 as v2.
Pull a rabbit.
    Insert 5 into v3.
    Cast f1 on ().
    Insert 5 into v2.
    State v3.
Done.
Pull a rabbit.
    v2 becomes cast f0 on (v2).
Done.

Define churn as a series of text.
Define tick as 0.
While tick is less than 400, repeat:
    Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
    tick becomes tick + 1.
Done.
State v2.
State v3.
